meta {
  name: LibraryController
  seq: 11
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
    GET  /libraries        admin
    POST /libraries        admin
    PUT  /libraries/{id}   admin
    GET  /libraries/loan-rules          admin, librarian
    PUT  /libraries/{id}/loan-rules     admin

  The school's libraries, sorted by name ignoring case. A librarian or a student
  gets 403.

  POST takes { name }: surrounding spaces are removed, 255 characters at most (400
  otherwise), and 409 if a library already bears that name, case aside.

  PUT takes { name } with the same rules and the same 409 as POST. Changing only the
  case of a library's own name is allowed. 404 if the id is unknown.

  GET /libraries/loan-rules lists every library, sorted by name like GET /libraries,
  with { id, name, borrowingDurationDays, pickupWindowDays }. A student gets 403.

  PUT /libraries/{id}/loan-rules takes { borrowingDurationDays, pickupWindowDays }:
  whole numbers of days from 1 to 365, both required, otherwise 400 and nothing is
  saved. 404 if the id is unknown. Existing borrowings and holds keep their dates.
}
